{"ref":"BDB, תּוֹלֵדוֹת","hw":"תּוֹלֵדוֹת","html":"<big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹלֵדוֹת</span></big><sub>39</sub><big>]</big>  <strong>n.f.pl. generations</strong>, especially in <strong>genealogies</strong> = <strong>account of a man and his descendants</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹלְדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:4\" href=\"/Genesis.2.4\">Gn 2:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:18\" href=\"/Ruth.4.18\">Ru 4:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹלְדֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:1\" href=\"/Genesis.5.1\">Gn 5:1</a> + 6 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּלְדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:1\" href=\"/Genesis.36.1\">36:1</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּלְדֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:12\" href=\"/Genesis.25.12\">25:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּלְדֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.31\">1 Ch 26:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹלְדֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:10\" href=\"/Exodus.28.10\">Ex 28:10</a> + 16 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּלְדוֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.7\">1 Ch 5:7</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּלְדֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:16\" href=\"/Exodus.6.16\">Ex 6:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:19\" href=\"/Exodus.6.19\">19</a>;—<br><strong>a.</strong>  <em>account of men and their descendants</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:1\" href=\"/Genesis.5.1\">Gn 5:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:9\" href=\"/Genesis.6.9\">6:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:1\" href=\"/Genesis.10.1\">10:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:10\" href=\"/Genesis.11.10\">11:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:27\" href=\"/Genesis.11.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:12\" href=\"/Genesis.25.12\">25:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:19\" href=\"/Genesis.25.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:1\" href=\"/Genesis.36.1\">36:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:9\" href=\"/Genesis.36.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:2\" href=\"/Genesis.37.2\">37:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:1\" href=\"/Numbers.3.1\">Nu 3:1</